@startuml system-element-boundary
title System / Element Boundary ; per ADR-ES-027 section 6 + Recon-ES-004

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "System" as Sys
class "Element" as Elem

Sys --> Elem : contains

note right
  Per Recon-ES-004:
  System is an organized whole of interacting elements.
  Element is a constituent.
  System is NOT Element.
end note

@enduml
